{"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber\/onlyBottom"},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onlyBottom"}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The number appears only on the bottom part of the current system."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber"]]},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:7IvorMXL23MXLSystemRelationNumberO10onlyBottomyA2CmF","role":"symbol","title":"MXLSystemRelationNumber.onlyBottom","symbolKind":"case","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"roleHeading":"Case","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onlyBottom","kind":"identifier"}]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber\/onlybottom"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"references":{"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSystemRelationNumber":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLSystemRelationNumber"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"enum"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MXLSystemRelationNumber"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The system-relation-number type distinguishes measure numbers that are associated with a system rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the particular part where the element appears. A value of only-top or only-bottom indicates that the number","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"should appear only on the top or bottom part of the current system, respectively. A value of also-top or also-","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"bottom indicates that the number should appear on both the current part and the top or bottom part of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current system, respectively. If these values appear in a score, when parts are created the number should only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"appear once in this part, not twice. A value of none indicates that the number is associated only with the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"current part, not with the system.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber","kind":"symbol","title":"MXLSystemRelationNumber"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL/MXLSystemRelationNumber/onlyBottom":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlsystemrelationnumber\/onlybottom","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"case"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onlyBottom"}],"abstract":[{"text":"The number appears only on the bottom part of the current system.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLSystemRelationNumber\/onlyBottom","kind":"symbol","title":"MXLSystemRelationNumber.onlyBottom"},"doc://IvorMXL/documentation/IvorMXL":{"url":"\/documentation\/ivormxl","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"collection","title":"IvorMXL","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A MusicXML parser, normalizer, validator, and formatter."}]}}}